    <string name="faq_q1">How is a test day counted?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Keep the app open for at least 30 seconds every day. With usage access this is checked automatically; without it, open the app from Track14 and come back after 30 seconds.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">What if I miss a day?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">One day is forgiven. Missing 2 days in a row or 3 days in total ends the test with a penalty.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">Where do I get Coin14?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">By testing other apps, leaving feedback or buying in the shop. Coin14 can\'t be exchanged for money.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">When is my app ready for production?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Google requires at least 12 testers for 14 days. The dashboard shows every tester\'s days.</string>
